@ApiAiMock_HostAddress = https://localhost:7127

### Confidence Analysis - Health Check
GET {{ApiAiMock_HostAddress}}/api/analysis
Accept: application/json

###

### Interview API - Get Status
GET {{ApiAiMock_HostAddress}}/api/InterviewAPI/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Interview API - Start Session
POST {{ApiAiMock_HostAddress}}/api/InterviewAPI/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateName": "John Doe",
  "position": "Software Developer",
  "interviewType": "Technical"
}

###

### Interview API - End Session
POST {{ApiAiMock_HostAddress}}/api/InterviewAPI/end
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012",
  "feedback": "Good interview, candidate showed strong technical skills",
  "rating": 8
}

###